{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんばんは！\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/01/19/7506690/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は個別握手会でした〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/01/19/7506690/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2015年1発目の個握だったからか\nあけましておめでとうが\n物凄く多かったです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それにプラスしてこの日は\n私の生誕祭もあったので\nお誕生日おめでとうも多かった。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これにより"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファン\n『あ〜！おはよう！\nそういえば\nあけましておめでとう！\n今年もよろしくね！\nそして、ちょっと早いけど\nお誕生日おめでとう！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私『あ、ありがとう...！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜終了〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていう詰め込み型な\n展開が多かった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても嬉しいんだけど、\nいかんせん時間が限られてるもので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうとか普通の事しか\n言えなくてごめんね...！(◎_◎;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっとボキャブラリー\n増やします！(◎_◎;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなわけで、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部終わりには\n生誕祭を開いて頂きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/01/19/7506690/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨年よりもたくさんの方々に\n祝って頂けて\n本当に嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オープニングで\n生まれたままでが掛かった時から\nいろいろな事を思い出して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙を堪えるのに必死でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方と一緒に歩んできた\n1年間。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝の気持ちを\n伝えなきゃいけないのに、\n口を開けば泣きそうに\nなってしまうので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"割とあっさりした挨拶に\nなってしまって\n本当にすみません（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにレーンは\n私の夢を応援してくれるのが\n全面に出ていた空間でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/01/19/7506690/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左上見えるかな？？？\nまさかのランウェイ仕様。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/01/19/7506690/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかのカバーガール仕様。\n左上の良いOLがツボ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/01/19/7506690/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこのアリスのポスターは\n(多分)完全に生誕委員の趣味。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/01/19/7506690/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花もありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"装飾1つ1つ凝っていて\n色んな発見を見つける度に\nほっこりして愛を感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生誕祭って絶対大変だし、\nお仕事とか学校の合間を縫って\n準備してくれてるんだろうな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思うと本当に\n感謝してもしきれないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"重ね重ね本当にありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにメンバーからは\nかりんがお手紙をくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣くの我慢してたのに、\n1番最初にかりんが泣くのは\nズルいよ！もう！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも日奈子、伊織、\n飛鳥、深川さんも来てくれて\n本当に嬉しかった（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/01/19/7506690/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう〜（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/01/19/7506690/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/01/19/7506690/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部2部3部と\nたくさんの方々にお祝いして\n貰えて素敵な1日になりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/01/19/7506690/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"22歳の私とは\nこれで握手納めです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は23歳になった\n私と会いましょう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜発表について。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんもご存知の通り\n私は今回もアンダーです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10枚目は本当にいろんな事が\nあった期間でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#乃木坂カフェの店長をやったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#アンダーライブセカンドシーズン\nにてダンケシェーンと\n君の名は希望のセンターを\nやらせて頂けたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#オールナイトニッポンRに\nアンダーで出させて頂けたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までにないくらい、\nたくさんのものを見ることが\n出来ました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルで居られる時間がない中で、\n結果を出せないのは全部自分のせい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"焦らないといえば\n嘘になるけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんがいてくれるから\n私は頑張れます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもいつも言ってるけど、\n支えてくれてありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"《順番じゃなくて\n順当な時に選抜に入りたい。》"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その為に、\n今は頑張るときだと思って精進します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥とまりちゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜おめでとう！\n一緒に過ごした時間が長い分\n2人が頑張ってるのを\n間近で見てきたからこそ、\n本当に嬉しいよ（ ;  ; ）❤︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人ならやってくれると\n信じてる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして伊織！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初選抜おめでとう！\nきっと慣れない環境で\n大変なことも多々あると思うけど\nいつでもBBAを頼ってね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"餌付けしながら\n話はいつでも聞くよ( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長くなりましたが、\n11枚目もよろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/01/19/7506690/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【告知】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日\n1/20 21:00〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アメーバスタジオにて\n「古坂大魔王のカツアゲ！」\nに生出演します〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優里さんとかりんと\n出るので是非見て下さい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/01/19/7506690/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はアメスタに集合ね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/01/19/7506690/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1/25 20:30〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文化放送\n乃木坂46の「の」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんちゃんと2人喋りします！\n2期生中心の話題ですが、\n色々話してきたので\n是非聴いて下さいー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2期生だけの回はこれが初！\n必見です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1/25 22:15〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フジテレビONE\n「ラーメンWalkerTV2」に\n出演します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"御徒町にある\n「チラナイサクラ」さんに\nお邪魔してきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラーメン好きだから\n嬉しい楽しい収録でした〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非見て下さいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/01/19/7506690/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\nまた更新します。"}],"source":"archive"}